Generic (dimension `n`) rules for the registered slice derivative `pd i f x = deriv (u ↦ f (x[i := u])) (x i)`
(`Atlas/Core/Basic.lean`, unchanged). Every rule is stated for `C^∞` fields on an **open** set `U`, so
